    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah. it's just... there's no \"moving on\" from this. you can't move on from being a different person. the athlete, the competitor... that person is dead. i'm just the ghost left behind. it feels more like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact that the real me isn't even here anymore. it feels like the story's already over, you know? like the credits are rolling and i'm just sitting here in the dark.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
